Set the InkProf folder as Current Folder. Run:
paths = setupInkProf(CheckPython=true);
startInkProfApp();
Run setupInkProf in each new MATLAB session. ArgyllCMS is normally discovered automatically on macOS. If needed, specify its tools folder using setupInkProf(ArgyllBin="/path/to/Argyll/bin",CheckPython=true).
